#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:43
msgid "What went horribly wrong?"
msgstr "¿Qué experimento salió mal?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:46
msgid ""
"There was an explosion, and you lost your sense of smell. Well, almost: "
"you can sniff out gold as a pig does truffles. Take a Tin of Snuff to "
"dampen the impact. Use it every day or become deprived."
msgstr ""
"Hubo una explosión y perdiste el sentido del olfato. Bueno, casi: puedes "
"olfatear el oro como un cerdo las trufas. Tienes una lata de rapé para "
"mitigar el daño. Úsala todos los días o quedarás Exhausto."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:49
msgid "Tin of Snuff"
msgstr "Lata de rapé"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:52
msgid "Use it every day or become deprived."
msgstr "Úsala todos los días o quedarás Exhausto."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:57 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid ""
"You dematerialized a beloved pet. Now it follows you around, invisible "
"but always present. Although it cannot interact with the physical realm, "
"you are able to share its senses. (Add a Fatigue each time.) It follows "
"basic commands."
msgstr ""
"Has desmaterializado a una querida mascota. Ahora te sigue a todas "
"partes, invisible pero siempre presente. Aunque ella no puede interactuar"
" en el reino físico, tú puedes percibir a través de sus sentidos (añade "
"una Fatiga tras cada uso). La mascota sigue órdenes básicas."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:60
msgid ""
"You were exposed to a long-acting truth serum whose effects have yet to "
"wear off. The disorder has its advantages: you cannot repeat lies you've "
"heard, either."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste expuesto a un suero de la verdad de acción prolongada cuyos "
"efectos aún no han desaparecido. El trastorno tiene sus ventajas: tampoco"
" puedes repetir las mentiras que has oído."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:63
msgid ""
"You were adept at creating fake gold, which is almost as good. "
"Eventually, your ruse was discovered, and you had to make a hasty "
"retreat. Take a heavy Metal Ingot and Gold Powder."
msgstr ""
"Eras experto en la creación de oro falso, que es casi tan bueno como el "
"real. Al final, descubrieron tu treta y tuviste que huir a toda prisa. "
"Tienes un pesado lingote de metal y oro en polvo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:66
msgid "Metal Ingot"
msgstr "Lingote de metal"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:70
msgid "Gold Powder"
msgstr "Oro en polvo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:77
msgid ""
"Your alchemical recipe worked, but a rival stole the blueprint before "
"your claims could be proven. Take a prototype Blunderbuss that takes one "
"round to reload, and a thirst for revenge."
msgstr ""
"Tu receta alquímica funcionó, pero un rival robó los planos antes de que "
"pudieras demostrar tus afirmaciones. Tienes un prototipo de trabuco que "
"tarda un turno en recargarse, y sed de venganza."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:80
msgid "Blunderbuss"
msgstr "Trabuco"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:82
msgid "Takes a round to reload"
msgstr "Tarda un turno en recargarse"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:87
msgid ""
"Ridiculed for discovering how to turn gold into lead, you were a laughing"
" stock. Take a bottle of Universal Solvent that dissolves anything it "
"touches into its constituent parts."
msgstr ""
"Ridiculizado por descubrir cómo convertir el oro en plomo, eras el "
"hazmerreír de todos. Tienes una botella de disolvente universal que "
"disuelve todo lo que toca en sus partes constituyentes."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:90
msgid "Universal Solvent"
msgstr "Disolvente universal"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:99
msgid "What alchemical marvel is the product of your latest ingenuity?"
msgstr "¿Qué maravilla alquímica es el producto de tu última genialidad?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:102
msgid ""
"Pyrophoric Gel: A sticky green fluid that catches fire when exposed to "
"air. It lasts for 8 hours and cannot be extinguished."
msgstr ""
"Gel pirofórico: un líquido verde pegajoso que se incendia al contacto con"
" el aire. Arde durante 8 horas y no puede extinguirse."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:105
msgid "Pyrophoric Gel"
msgstr "Gel pirofórico"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:111
msgid ""
"Blast Sphere: A head-sized iron ball filled with explosive powder that "
"detonates on impact."
msgstr ""

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:114
msgid "Blast Sphere"
msgstr "Esfera explosiva"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:120
msgid ""
"Aqua Vita: Purifies any liquid, converting it to pure water. Drinking it "
"cures 1d6 STR."
msgstr ""
"Aqua vitae: purifica cualquier líquido, convirtiéndolo en agua pura. "
"Beberla cura 1d6 de FUE."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:123
msgid "Aqua Vita"
msgstr "Aqua vitae"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:130
msgid "Mimic Stone: Records a short phrase that can later be played back."
msgstr ""
"Piedra imitadora: captura una frase corta que puede repetir "
"posteriormente."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:133
msgid "Mimic Stone"
msgstr "Piedra imitadora"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:135
msgid "Records a short phrase that can later be played back."
msgstr "Captura una frase corta que puede repetir posteriormente."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:140
msgid ""
"Spark Dust: Ignites easily and quickly. Useful for starting a fire or as "
"an incendiary device."
msgstr ""
"Polvo chispeante: se enciende fácil y rápidamente. Útil para encender "
"fuego o como artefacto incendiario."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:143
msgid "Spark Dust"
msgstr "Polvo chispeante"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:150 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid ""
"Homunculus: A miniature clay replica of yourself that follows your every "
"command. It hates being enthralled to you and complains bitterly whenever"
" possible. Any damage done to the homunculus is also done to you. 3 HP, 4"
" STR, 13 DEX, 5 WIL."
msgstr ""
"Homúnculo: una réplica de arcilla en miniatura de ti mismo que sigue "
"todas tus órdenes. Odia estar vinculado a ti y se queja amargamente "
"siempre que puede. Cualquier daño infligido al homúnculo te afecta a ti. "
"PG 3, FUE 4, DES 13, VOL 5."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:153 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid "Homunculus"
msgstr "Homúnculo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/aurifex.json:155
msgid ""
"A miniature clay replica of yourself that follows your every command. It "
"hates being enthralled to you and complains bitterly whenever possible. "
"Any damage done to the homunculus is also done to you. 3 HP, 4 STR, 13 "
"DEX, 5 WIL"
msgstr ""
"Una réplica de arcilla en miniatura de ti mismo que sigue todas tus "
"órdenes. Odia estar vinculado a ti y se queja amargamente siempre que "
"puede. Cualquier daño infligido al homúnculo te afecta a ti. PG 3, FUE 4,"
" DES 13, VOL 5"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:4
msgid ""
"You walk the line between healer and harrower, knowing the frailty of the"
" flesh but also the secrets that lie within. With the right tools, life "
"and death are merely words."
msgstr ""
"Caminas en la delgada línea entre quien sana y quien hace sufrir. Conoces"
" la fragilidad de la carne, pero también los secretos que se esconden en "
"su interior. Con las herramientas adecuadas, vida y muerte son meras "
"palabras."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:31
msgid "Bonesaw"
msgstr "Sierra amputadora"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:35
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:58
#: app/static/json/marketplace.json:1
msgid "Bandages"
msgstr "Vendajes"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:40
msgid "Leech"
msgstr "Sanguijuela"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:43
msgid "Restores 1 STR"
msgstr "Restaura 1 de FUE"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:46
msgid "Stained medical finery"
msgstr "Instrumentos quirúrgicos ensangrentados"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:51
msgid "How have you 'improved' yourself?"
msgstr "¿Qué «mejoras» añadiste a tu cuerpo?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:54
msgid ""
"You have a replacement eye that can magnify objects, act as a telescope, "
"and provide minimal night vision. You cannot wear anything metal on your "
"head, and the presence of strong magnets make you deprived."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un ojo artificial que puede magnificar objetos, hacer de catalejo "
"y proporcionar una visión nocturna mínima. No puedes llevar nada metálico"
" en la cabeza, y la presencia de imanes potentes te deja Exhausto."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:58
msgid ""
"One foot is mostly metal (kick, d6), and you treat some tough terrain as "
"Easy. Carry an Oil Can (6 uses). Without a daily application, you are "
"deprived and noisy."
msgstr ""
"Un pie es en su mayoría metálico (patada, d6), y tratas algunos terrenos "
"Duros como Fáciles. Llevas una lata de aceite (6 usos). Sin una "
"aplicación diaria, quedas Exhausto y haces mucho ruido al caminar."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:64
msgid "Without a daily application you are deprived and noisy."
msgstr "Sin una aplicación diaria, quedas Exhausto y haces mucho ruido al caminar."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:69
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has been swapped, the bone replaced by gold and iron."
" Take a Hook and a Screwdriver that can attach to the fingertip."
msgstr ""
"Reemplazaste uno de tus dedos y sustituiste el hueso por oro y hierro. "
"Tienes un gancho y un destornillador que se pueden acoplar a la punta del"
" dedo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:72
msgid "Hook & Screwdriver"
msgstr "Gancho y destornillador"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:74
msgid "Attaches to mechanical finger."
msgstr "Se acoplan al dedo mecánico."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:79
msgid ""
"Both ears have been surgically enhanced, tripling your hearing. You can "
"focus on a specific sound, such as a conversation, at a great distance. "
"You wear an ear flap to protect against sudden loud noises (WIL save to "
"avoid temporary paralysis)."
msgstr ""
"Mejoraste quirúrgicamente ambos oídos, triplicando tu capacidad auditiva."
" Puedes concentrarte en un sonido específico, como una conversación, a "
"gran distancia. Llevas un protector auditivo contra los ruidos fuertes "
"repentinos (Salvación de VOL para evitar quedar paralizado "
"temporalmente)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:83
msgid ""
"Your chest is lined with alchemical sigils, toughening the skin (Armor "
"1). Wearing other metallic armor nullifies the effect."
msgstr ""
"Tu pecho está revestido de sigilos alquímicos que endurecen la piel "
"(Armadura 1). Si llevas otra armadura metálica, el efecto se anula."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:86
msgid "Alchemical Sigils"
msgstr "Sigilos alquímicos"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:88
msgid ""
"Your chest is lined with alchemical sigils, _toughening the skin_ (1 "
"Armor)."
msgstr ""
"Tu pecho está revestido de sigilos alquímicos que _endurecen la piel_ (1 "
"Armadura)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:93
msgid ""
"One arm is fully metal and comes off at the shoulder. It can be used as a"
" weapon (d8, bulky when not attached) and can move independently if you "
"are within sight of it."
msgstr ""
"Un brazo es completamente metálico y se desprende a la altura del hombro."
" Puede usarse como arma (d8, Voluminoso cuando no está unido a tu cuerpo)"
" y puede moverse por sí solo si lo tienes a la vista."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:99
msgid "What rare tool is essential to your work?"
msgstr "¿Qué herramienta extraña necesitas en tu oficio?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:102
msgid "Regrowth Salve: Regrows a body part over the course of a day. 1 use."
msgstr ""
"Ungüento regenerador: regenera una parte del cuerpo en el transcurso de "
"un día. 1 uso."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:105
msgid "Regrowth Salve"
msgstr "Ungüento regenerador"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:108
msgid "Regrows a body part over the course of a day."
msgstr "Regenera una parte del cuerpo en el transcurso de un día."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:113
msgid ""
"Graftgrub: A small worm that can fuse inanimate objects with parts of the"
" body. 1 use."
msgstr ""
"Larva injertadora: un pequeño gusano que puede fusionar objetos "
"inanimados con partes del cuerpo. 1 uso."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:116
msgid "Graftgrub"
msgstr "Larva injertadora"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:119
msgid "Fuses inanimate objects with parts of the body."
msgstr "Fusiona objetos inanimados con partes del cuerpo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:124
msgid ""
"Woundwax: Heals wounds from fire or chemicals (restoring full STR) but "
"nothing else. 2 uses."
msgstr ""
"Cera para heridas: cura heridas causadas por fuego o sustancias químicas "
"(restaura toda la FUE), pero nada más. 2 usos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:127
msgid "Woundwax"
msgstr "Cera para heridas"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/barber-surgeon.json:1
