msgstr "Jubón de cuero"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:65
msgid ""
"A wizened apothecary, who taught you the healing arts but maintained a "
"clinical detachment. Take a Healing Unguent (restores d4 STR)."
msgstr ""
"Un viejo boticario que te enseñó las artes curativas, pero siempre guardó"
" las distancias. Tienes un bálsamo curativo (restaura d4 de FUE)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:68
msgid "Healing Unguent"
msgstr "Bálsamo curativo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:71
msgid "Restores d4 STR"
msgstr "Restaura d4 de FUE"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:76
msgid ""
"A druid, who taught you the language of trees. When it came time to "
"leave, you took with you only a Gnarled Staff (d8) and left a promise "
"that one day you would return."
msgstr ""
"Un druida, que te enseñó el lenguaje de los árboles. Cuando llegó el "
"momento de partir, solo te llevaste un báculo nudoso (d8) y dejaste la "
"promesa de que algún día volverías."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:79
msgid "Gnarled Staff"
msgstr "Báculo nudoso"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:85
msgid ""
"A gruff blacksmith from a sleepy river town. You were always kept at "
"arm's length. Now the forge is cold, and you've moved on. Take a Smith's "
"Apron (petty) and a set of Oft-mended Chain Mail (2 Armor, bulky)."
msgstr ""
"Un herrero huraño de un aletargado pueblo ribereño. Siempre te mantuvo a "
"distancia. Ahora la forja está fría y has seguido tu camino. Tienes un "
"delantal de herrero (Insignificante) y una cota de malla muy remendada (2"
" Armadura, Voluminosa)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:88
msgid "Smith's Apron"
msgstr "Delantal de herrero"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:92
msgid "Oft-mended Chain Mail"
msgstr "Cota de malla remendada"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:98
msgid ""
"A troupe of traveling entertainers. For a time, they were like family to "
"you. One day you woke up and they were gone with no explanation. Take a "
"Storybook, a Dagger (d6), and some burning questions."
msgstr ""
"Una compañía de artistas ambulantes. Durante un tiempo, fueron como tu "
"familia. Un día te despertaste y se habían ido sin ninguna explicación. "
"Tienes un libro de cuentos, una daga (d6) y muchas preguntas sin "
"respuesta."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:101
msgid "Storybook"
msgstr "Libro de cuentos"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:111
msgid ""
"The monks of a secluded forest monastery. When their rules became too "
"strict, and you snuck away. Take a Monk's Habit (warm, petty) and a "
"Spellbook of Control Plants."
msgstr ""
"Los monjes de un aislado monasterio en la floresta. Cuando sus normas se "
"volvieron demasiado estrictas, te escabulliste. Tienes un hábito de monje"
" (cálido, Insignificante) y un Libro de Hechizos (Controlar Plantas)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:114
msgid "Monk's Habit"
msgstr "Hábito de monje"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:116
msgid "Warm"
msgstr "Cálido"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:119
msgid "Spellbook (Control Plants)"
msgstr "Libro de Hechizos (Controlar Plantas)"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:120
msgid ""
"Nearby plants and trees obey you and gain the ability to move at a slow "
"pace. Leaves grow along the spine, and it smells faintly of decay."
msgstr ""
"Las plantas y árboles cercanos te obedecen y adquieren la habilidad de "
"moverse a paso lento. Crecen hojas a lo largo del lomo y huele "
"ligeramente a podredumbre."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:128
msgid "What keeps bad tidings at bay?"
msgstr "¿Cuál de tus posesiones te da suerte?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:131
msgid ""
"Pipeweed: Your good luck charm. Conversations tend to flow more easily "
"after a smoke. 6 uses."
msgstr ""
"Hierbas para pipa: tu amuleto de la suerte. Las conversaciones tienden a "
"fluir mejor tras fumar. 6 usos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:134
msgid "Pipeweed"
msgstr "Hierbas para pipa"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:137
msgid ""
"Your good luck charm. Conversations tend to flow more easily after a "
"smoke."
msgstr ""
"Tu amuleto de la suerte. Las conversaciones tienden a fluir mejor tras "
"fumar."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:142
msgid ""
"Stink Jar: Shattering this jar releases an odor so foul all nearby must "
"make a STR save or immediately vomit. 1 use."
msgstr ""
"Jarra apestosa: al romperla se libera un olor tan repugnante que todos "
"los que estén cerca deben superar una Salvación de FUE o vomitar en el "
"acto. 1 uso."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/foundling.json:145
