#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:47
msgid ""
"Ward: A silver circle 50ft across appears on the ground. Choose one "
"species that cannot cross it."
msgstr ""
"Proteger: en el suelo aparece un círculo plateado de 15 metros de "
"diámetro. Elige una especie que no podrá cruzarlo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:51
msgid "How has the Wood failed you?"
msgstr "¿Cuándo te falló el Bosque?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:54
msgid ""
"An ill-tempered forest spirit cursed you for stealing, marking you as an "
"enemy of their kind. Take a Bezoar Stone. Ingesting it cures any poison "
"(1 use, unless retrieved)."
msgstr ""
"Un espíritu del bosque malhumorado te maldijo por robar, señalándote como"
" enemigo de su especie. Tienes una piedra de bezoar. Tragarla cura "
"cualquier veneno (1 uso, a menos que la recuperes)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:57
msgid "Bezoar Stone"
msgstr "Piedra de bezoar"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:60
msgid "Ingesting it cures any poison (1 use, unless retrieved)."
msgstr "Tragarla cura cualquier veneno (1 uso, a menos que la recuperes)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:65
msgid ""
"A close friend disappeared into the forest. Now you see their face in any"
" tea you brew. Take a Soporific Concoction (3 uses)."
msgstr ""
"Un amigo íntimo desapareció en el bosque. Ahora ves su rostro en "
"cualquier té que prepares. Tienes una poción somnífera (3 usos)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:68
msgid "Soporific Concoction"
msgstr "Poción somnífera"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:75
msgid ""
"You were poisoned, losing your sense of taste and smell. You can now "
"withstand noxious fumes and always carry Antitoxin (2 uses)."
msgstr ""
"Te envenenaron y perdiste los sentidos del gusto y del olfato. Ahora "
"puedes soportar gases nocivos y siempre llevas antitoxina (2 usos)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:85
msgid ""
"Your radical experiments turned your skin green, and you now gain "
"nourishment as a plant. You don't need Rations, but a day without "
"sufficient sunlight and water leaves you deprived."
msgstr ""
"Tus experimentos radicales volvieron tu piel verde, y ahora te nutres "
"como una planta. No necesitas Raciones, pero un día sin suficiente luz "
"solar y agua te deja Exhausto."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:88
msgid ""
"Your impressive corpseflower won a local contest then promptly killed a "
"judge. You fled, but not without the Prize Money (100gp) and a warrant "
"for your arrest."
msgstr ""
"Tu impresionante flor cadáver ganó un concurso local y acto seguido mató "
"a un juez. Huiste, pero no sin el dinero del premio (100 mo) y una orden "
"de arresto."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:93
msgid ""
"You created a restorative tincture that also causes accidental "
"infertility. Take a Healing Potion that completely restores STR. Only you"
" know of its unintended side-effects."
msgstr ""
"Creaste una tintura reconstituyente que también causa infertilidad por "
"accidente. Tienes una poción curativa que restaura por completo la FUE. "
"Solo tú conoces sus efectos secundarios."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:96
msgid "Healing Potion"
msgstr "Poción curativa"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:99
msgid "Completely restores STR. Only you know of its unintended side-effects."
msgstr "Restaura por completo la FUE. Solo tú conoces sus efectos secundarios."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/greenwise.json:106
