"Atrapa a cualquier criatura de hasta el tamaño de un caballo (FUE para "
"liberarse). Reutilizable."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:4
msgid ""
"Born of both the mortal world and the unseen, you are an enigma to some "
"and feared by many. Yours is the tale of what happens when two worlds "
"collide."
msgstr ""
"Nacida tanto del mundo de los mortales como del que no se ve a simple "
"vista, eres enigmática para unos y aterradora para otros. Tu historia es "
"un ejemplo de lo que ocurre cuando dos mundos chocan."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:31
msgid "Spellbook (Thicket)"
msgstr "Libro de Hechizos (Espesura)"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:33
msgid ""
"A thicket of trees and dense brush up to 50ft wide suddenly sprouts up. "
"Wrapped in vines that must be destroyed again with each use."
msgstr ""
"Surge repentinamente una espesura de árboles y densos matorrales de hasta"
" 15 m de ancho. El libro queda cubierto de enredaderas que deben "
"destruirse para volver a usarlo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:36
msgid "Iron Dagger"
msgstr "Daga de hierro"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:40
msgid "Herbs Pouch"
msgstr "Bolsa de hierbas"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:43
