msgstr "Restaura 1 de FUE."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:46
msgid "Ghillie Suit"
msgstr "Ropa de camuflaje"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:51
msgid "What did you bring back from the Unseelie Court?"
msgstr "¿Con qué regresaste de la corte de las Hadas Unseelie?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:54
msgid ""
"A Black Rose Fiddle (bulky). Its music causes intense sadness and "
"immobility in nearby mortals. (Others are merely fascinated.) You don't "
"know how to play."
msgstr ""
"Un violín de rosa negra (Voluminoso). Su música causa una intensa "
"tristeza e inmovilidad en los mortales cercanos (el resto solo quedan "
"fascinados). No sabes cómo tocarlo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:57
msgid "Black Rose Fiddle"
msgstr "Violín de rosa negra"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:59
msgid ""
"Its music causes intense sadness and immobility in nearby mortals. "
"(Others are merely fascinated.) You don't know how to play."
msgstr ""
"Su música causa una intensa tristeza e inmovilidad en los mortales "
"cercanos (el resto solo quedan fascinados). No sabes cómo tocarlo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:64
msgid ""
"Paper legs. You are extremely light and can fall a few stories without "
"getting hurt. Try to avoid tearing them or getting them wet."
msgstr ""
"Piernas de papel. Eres extremadamente ligera y puedes caer desde varios "
"pisos de altura sin lastimarte. Intenta evitar que se te rasguen o mojen."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:67
msgid "Paper Legs"
msgstr "Piernas de papel"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:69
msgid ""
"You are extremely light and can fall a few stories without getting hurt. "
"Try to avoid tearing them or getting them wet."
msgstr ""
"Eres extremadamente ligera y puedes caer desde varios pisos de altura sin"
" lastimarte. Intenta evitar que se te rasguen o mojen."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:74 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid ""
"A Living Nightmare that dwells within you but manifests whenever you are "
"in danger. It has your same Attributes and HP and attacks with claws "
"(d8+d8). It disappears on Critical Damage (take 1d4 WIL damage), re-"
"appearing again on the next full moon."
msgstr ""
"Pesadilla viviente que habita en ti y se manifiesta cuando estás en "
"peligro. Tiene tus mismas Características y PG, y ataca con garras "
"(d8+d8). Desaparece al recibir Daño Crítico (recibes 1d4 de daño a VOL) y"
" reaparece en la siguiente luna llena."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:77 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid "Living Nightmare"
msgstr "Pesadilla viviente"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:79
msgid ""
"Manifests whenever you are in danger. It has your same Attributes and HP "
"and attacks with claws (d8+d8). It disappears on Critical Damage (take "
"1d4 WIL damage), re-appearing again on the next full moon."
msgstr ""
"Se manifiesta cuando estás en peligro. Tiene tus mismas Características y"
" PG, y ataca con garras (d8+d8). Desaparece al recibir Daño Crítico "
"(recibes 1d4 de daño a VOL) y reaparece en la siguiente luna llena."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:84 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid ""
"A Raven Familiar [8 HP, 3 STR, 11 DEX, 13 WIL, beak, (d6)]. It speaks as "
"an intelligent being and is entirely devoted to you."
msgstr ""
"Un cuervo, como familiar [PG 8, FUE 3, DES 11, VOL 13, pico (d6)]. Habla "
"como un ser inteligente y está completamente entregado a ti."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:87 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid "Raven Familiar"
msgstr "Cuervo familiar"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:89
msgid ""
"[8 HP, 3 STR, 11 DEX, 13 WIL, beak, (d6)]. It speaks as an intelligent "
"being and is entirely devoted to you."
msgstr ""
"[PG 8, FUE 3, DES 11, VOL 13, pico (d6)]. Habla como un ser inteligente y"
" está completamente entregado a ti."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:94
msgid ""
"A Briar Thorn. It can pierce any organic material (quite painfully) but "
"when removed leaves no trace of the intrusion."
msgstr ""
"Espina de zarza. Puede perforar cualquier material orgánico (provoca "
"mucho dolor) pero, al ser retirada, no deja rastro de la perforación."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:97
msgid "Briar Thorn"
msgstr "Espina de zarza"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:99
msgid "Can pierce any organic material without leaving a trace."
msgstr "Puede perforar cualquier material orgánico sin dejar rastro."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:104
msgid ""
"A Fae creature's True Name. Use it to summon its owner for an act of "
"great service, but only once. It could also fetch a hefty price, from the"
" right buyer."
msgstr ""
"Conoces el nombre verdadero de una criatura férica. Puedes invocar al "
"propietario de ese nombre para que te preste un gran servicio, pero solo "
"una vez. También puedes vender el nombre a un precio alto, si consigues "
"un buen comprador."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:110
msgid ""
"What concoction do you carry, and what rare ingredients did you gather to"
" make it?"
msgstr "¿Qué poción portas y con qué ingredientes raros la elaboraste?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:113
msgid ""
"Rebirth Ash: Remnants of a bark spirit. Sprinkle to reignite a fire that "
"has died or return to life a creature that has died only moments before. "
"3 uses."
msgstr ""
"Cenizas revitalizantes: restos de un espíritu de los árboles. "
"Espolvoréalas para reavivar la llama de un fuego extinguido o devolver a "
"la vida a una criatura que ha muerto hace apenas unos instantes. 3 usos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:116
msgid "Rebirth Ash"
msgstr "Cenizas revitalizantes"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:119
msgid ""
"Remnants of a bark spirit. Sprinkle to reignite a fire or return to life "
"a recently deceased creature."
msgstr ""
"Restos de un espíritu de los árboles. Espolvoréalas para reavivar un "
"fuego o devolver a la vida a una criatura que acaba de morir."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:124
msgid ""
"Glamour Feather: Plume of a firebird. Can make any creature appear "
"convincingly as someone (or something) else. 1 use."
msgstr ""
"Pluma de glamur: pluma de un ave de fuego. Puede hacer que cualquier "
"criatura se parezca a otra (o incluso a una cosa) de manera convincente. "
"1 uso."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:127
msgid "Glamour Feather"
msgstr "Pluma de glamur"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:130
msgid "Can make any creature appear as someone or something else."
msgstr "Puede hacer que cualquier criatura se parezca a otra o incluso a una cosa."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:135
msgid ""
"Hawthorn Seed: An acorn from the other side, gathered on the spring "
"equinox. When planted, it sprouts a luxurious shelter, collapsing at "
"moonrise the next day. 1 use."
msgstr ""
"Semilla de espino blanco: semilla de un fruto del Otro Mundo, recogida "
"durante el equinoccio de primavera. Al plantarla, brota un refugio lujoso"
" que se derrumba al día siguiente, al salir la luna. 1 uso."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:138
msgid "Hawthorn Seed"
msgstr "Semilla de espino blanco"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:141
msgid ""
"An acorn from the other side, gathered on the spring equinox. When "
"planted, it sprouts a luxurious shelter, collapsing at moonrise the next "
"day."
msgstr ""
"Semilla de un fruto del Otro Mundo, recogida durante el equinoccio de "
"primavera. Al plantarla, brota un refugio lujoso que se derrumba al día "
"siguiente, al salir la luna."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:146
msgid ""
"Stonetree Sap: Sap obtained in exchange for blood. Hardens when rubbed on"
" any surface (+1 Armor). 3 uses."
msgstr ""
"Savia del árbol de piedra: savia obtenida a cambio de sangre. Se endurece"
" cuando se frota sobre cualquier tipo de superficie (+1 Armadura). 3 "
"usos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:149
msgid "Stonetree Sap"
msgstr "Savia del árbol de piedra"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:152
msgid ""
"Sap obtained in exchange for blood. Hardens when rubbed on any surface "
"(+1 Armor)."
msgstr ""
"Savia obtenida a cambio de sangre. Se endurece cuando se frota sobre "
"cualquier tipo de superficie (+1 Armadura)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:157
msgid ""
"Nightdust Powder: The ritual burning of six owls. When tossed in the air,"
" day turns to night for a short while. 2 uses."
msgstr ""
"Polvo nocturno: hecho a partir de la quema ritual de seis búhos. Al "
"lanzarlo al aire, el día se convierte en noche durante un breve periodo "
"de tiempo. 2 usos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:160
msgid "Nightdust Powder"
msgstr "Polvo nocturno"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:163
msgid "Day turns to night for a short while when tossed in the air."
msgstr ""
"Al lanzarlo al aire, el día se convierte en noche durante un breve "
"periodo de tiempo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:168
msgid ""
"Hex Stone: Gathered from a river that flows from the other side. Removed "
"from its iron tin, it can absorb the effects of an active magical effect."
" If destroyed, the magic is released. 1 use."
msgstr ""
"Piedra arcana: recolectada de un río que fluye desde el Otro Mundo. Al "
"sacarla de su lata de hierro, puede absorber los efectos de un poder "
"mágico activo. Al destruirla, el poder se libera. 1 uso."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:171
msgid "Hex Stone"
msgstr "Piedra arcana"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/half-witch.json:174
msgid "Absorbs an active magical effect; releasing it if destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Absorbe los efectos de un poder mágico activo; al destruirla, el poder se"
" libera."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:4
msgid ""
"You are a mere digit on the unerring hand of justice. You go where others"
" fear to tread, unyielding and unbroken."
msgstr ""
"Eres un mero dígito en la infalible mano de la justicia. Vas donde otros "
"temen pisar, íntegro y tenaz."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:31
msgid "Vestments of the Order"
msgstr "Uniforme de tu Orden"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:35
msgid "Blessed Tinctures"
msgstr "Tinturas benditas"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:39
msgid "Silver Knife"
msgstr "Cuchillo de plata"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:43
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:99
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:39
#: app/static/json/marketplace.json:1
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "Ballesta"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:48
msgid "To which order do you belong?"
msgstr "¿A qué Orden perteneces?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:51
msgid ""
"Order of the Crossroads. Take a Pocket Leyfinder. It points to nearby ley"
" lines and other sources of arcane power. If you lose it, the punishment "
"is death."
msgstr ""
"Orden de las Encrucijadas. Tienes un buscador de Líneas Ley de bolsillo. "
"Apunta hacia las Líneas Ley cercanas y otras fuentes de poder arcano. Si "
"lo pierdes, el castigo es la muerte."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:54
msgid "Pocket Leyfinder"
msgstr "Buscador de Líneas Ley de bolsillo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:56
msgid ""
"It points to nearby ley lines and other sources of arcane power. If you "
"lose it, the punishment is death."
msgstr ""
"Apunta hacia las Líneas Ley cercanas y otras fuentes de poder arcano. Si "
"lo pierdes, el castigo es la muerte."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:61
msgid ""
"Order of the Bleeding Star. Take a Star-Iron Mace (d8). It shines faintly"
" in darkness and becomes very hot in the presence of witchcraft."
msgstr ""
"Orden de la Estrella Sangrante. Tienes una maza de hierro estelar (d8). "
"Brilla tenuemente en la oscuridad y se calienta mucho en presencia de "
"brujería."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:64
msgid "Star-Iron Mace"
msgstr "Maza de hierro estelar"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:66
msgid ""
"It shines faintly in darkness and becomes very hot in the presence of "
"witchcraft."
msgstr ""
"Brilla tenuemente en la oscuridad y se calienta mucho en presencia de "
"brujería."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:71
msgid ""
"Order of the Glass Sigil. Take a short sword (d8) and chainmail (2 Armor,"
" bulky). You have contacts in most towns (the more rural, the better) "
"willing to provide aid, food, or even weapons."
msgstr ""
"Orden del Sello de Vidrio. Tienes una espada corta (d8) y una cota de "
"malla (Armadura 2, Voluminosa). Tienes contactos en casi todos los "
"pueblos (cuanto más rural, mejor) dispuestos a proporcionarte ayuda, "
"comida o incluso armas."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:74
msgid "Short sword"
msgstr "Espada corta"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:78
#: app/static/json/hirelings.json:1 app/static/json/marketplace.json:1
msgid "Chainmail"
msgstr "Cota de malla"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:84
msgid ""
"Order of the Blank Eye. Take a Voidglass Shard. Peer through it to see "
"invisible marks, creatures, and other magical effects. Lose the use of "
"your eye for an hour afterwards (you are deprived)."
msgstr ""
"Orden del Ojo Blanco. Tienes un fragmento de cristal del Vacío. Mira a "
"través de él para ver marcas invisibles, criaturas y otros efectos "
"mágicos. Después pierdes la visión de ese ojo durante una hora (quedas "
"Exhausto)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:87
msgid "Voidglass Shard"
msgstr "Fragmento de cristal del Vacío"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:89
msgid ""
"Peer through it to see invisible marks, creatures, and other magical "
"effects. Lose the use of your eye for an hour afterwards (you are "
"deprived)."
msgstr ""
"Mira a través de él para ver marcas invisibles, criaturas y otros efectos"
" mágicos. Después pierdes la visión de ese ojo durante una hora (quedas "
"Exhausto)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:94
msgid ""
"Order of Canaas. Once per day you can change into a wolf. Take a "
"Quicksilver Chain. Without it, you are unable to shift back."
msgstr ""
"Orden de Canaas. Una vez al día puedes transformarte en lobo. Tienes una "
"cadena de azogue. Sin ella, no puedes volver a tu forma original."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:97
msgid "Quicksilver Chain"
msgstr "Cadena de azogue"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:99
msgid "Without it, you are unable to shift back."
msgstr "Sin ella, no puedes volver a tu forma original."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:104
msgid ""
"Order of the Silent Veil. Take a Quell Stone (2 uses) wrapped in burlap. "
"Extinguishes any nearby flames once exposed to air."
msgstr ""
"Orden del Velo Silencioso. Tienes una piedra apagafuegos (2 usos) "
"envuelta en arpillera. Una vez expuesta al aire, extingue cualquier llama"
" cercana."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:107
msgid "Quell Stone"
msgstr "Piedra apagafuegos"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:110
msgid "Extinguishes any nearby flames once exposed to air."
msgstr "Una vez expuesta al aire, extingue cualquier llama cercana."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:117
msgid "What was your vow?"
msgstr "¿Qué votos hiciste?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:120
msgid ""
"Honesty. Choose a weapon type (blunt, blade, etc). Attacks against you of"
" this type are impaired. If your vow is broken, you lose d4 WIL."
msgstr ""
"Honestidad. Elige un tipo de arma (contundente, cortante, etc.). Los "
"ataques contra ti de este tipo tienen Desventaja. Si rompes tu voto, "
"pierdes d4 de VOL."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:124
msgid ""
"Poverty. You carry the Disassemble Spellbook. Only you can use it. If "
"your vow is broken, it explodes (d12 STR damage)."
msgstr ""
"Pobreza. Tienes un Libro de Hechizos (Desmontar). Solo tú puedes usarlo. "
"Si rompes tu voto, explota (d12 de daño a FUE)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:127
msgid "Spellbook (Disassemble)"
msgstr "Libro de Hechizos (Desmontar)"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:129
msgid ""
"Any of your body parts may be detached and reattached at will, without "
"causing pain or damage. You can still control them. Only you can use it. "
"If your vow is broken, it explodes (d12 STR damage). Regenerates any torn"
" or defaced pages."
msgstr ""
"Puedes separar y volver a unir cualquier parte de tu cuerpo a voluntad, "
"sin sufrir daño ni dolor. Mantienes el control sobre las partes "
"separadas. Solo tú puedes usarlo. Si rompes tu voto, explota (d12 de daño"
" a FUE). Regenera cualquier página rasgada o dañada."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:134
msgid ""
"Selflessness. You are immune to mind-altering magical effects, such as "
"charm, hatred, frenzy, and so on. If you break this vow, you lose d6 WIL."
msgstr ""
"Altruismo. Eres inmune a los efectos mágicos que alteran la mente, como "
"Encantar, Odio, Frenesí, etc. Si rompes tu voto, pierdes d6 de VOL."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:138
msgid ""
"Mercy. Choose a weapon type (blunt, blade, etc). Attacks with this weapon"
" are enhanced. If your vow is broken, you can never use that weapon type "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Misericordia. Elige un tipo de arma (contundente, cortante, etc.). Tus "
"ataques con ese tipo de arma tienen Ventaja. Si rompes tu voto, nunca "
"podrás volver a usar ese tipo de arma."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:142
msgid ""
"Charity. Once per day, you can shrug off a Fatigue. If your vow is ever "
"broken, you permanently lose one inventory slot."
msgstr ""
"Caridad. Una vez al día puedes librarte de una Fatiga. Si rompes tu voto,"
" pierdes para siempre un espacio de tu Inventario."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/hexenbane.json:146
msgid ""
"Valor. The first time you inflict Critical Damage, you receive +d4 HP, "
"returning to the previous limit at the end of combat. If your vow is "
"broken, you die."
msgstr ""
"Valentía. La primera vez que infliges Daño Crítico, ganas +d4 PG y "
"vuelves a tu cantidad previa de PG al final del combate. Si rompes tu "
"voto, mueres."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:4
msgid ""
"What inspires the soul more than song, words, and spectacle? Why practice"
" for years to master the arcane when you've already got real magic "
"inside?"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué inspira más al alma que una canción, unas estrofas y una buena "
"actuación? ¿Por qué practicar durante años para dominar lo arcano cuando "
"ya tienes la verdadera magia dentro de ti?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:14
#: app/static/json/generators/factions.json:1
#: app/static/json/generators/names.json:1
#: app/static/json/generators/realm.json:1
#: app/static/json/party_events/factions.json:195
#: app/static/json/party_events/names.json:46
#: app/static/json/party_events/setting.json:406
#: app/static/json/party_events/setting.json:1138
msgid "Echo"
msgstr ""

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:31
msgid "Costume"
msgstr "Disfraz"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:35
msgid "Simple Instrument (Pipes, Lute, etc.)"
msgstr "Instrumento sencillo (flauta, laúd, etc.)"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:39
msgid "Lucky Jerkin"
msgstr "Jubón de la suerte"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:48
msgid "What happened at your final performance?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasó en tu última actuación?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:51
msgid ""
"Despite your training in the deadly arts, an actor died and you were "
"blamed. Take a light-weight Rapier (d6) and a false identity."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de tu preparación para realizar actos peligrosos, un actor murió "
"y te culparon. Tienes un estoque corto (d6) y usas una identidad falsa."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:54
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:117
msgid "Rapier"
msgstr "Estoque"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:60
msgid ""
"The crowd loved your catchy tune about a noble and his romantic failings."
" The noble in question, not so much. Take the Read Mind Spellbook and a "
"warrant for your arrest."
msgstr ""
"Al público le encantó tu melodía pegadiza sobre un noble y sus fracasos "
"amorosos. Al noble en cuestión, no tanto. Tienes un Libro de Hechizos "
"(Leer mentes) y una orden de arresto."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:63
msgid "Read Mind Spellbook"
msgstr "Libro de Hechizos (Leer mentes)"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:65
msgid ""
"You can hear the surface thoughts of nearby creatures. Long-term "
"possession can cause the reader to mistake the thoughts of others as "
"their own."
msgstr ""
"Puedes oír los pensamientos superficiales de las criaturas cercanas. "
"Utilizarlo prolongadamente puede hacer que el lector confunda los "
"pensamientos de los demás con los suyos propios."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:70
msgid ""
"Your debut composition reduced the audience to a gibbering mess, "
"murmuring of bright creatures descending from the night sky. Later you "
"noticed that the notes resembled stellar constellations. Take a Book On "
"Astronomy and a lot of questions."
msgstr ""
"Tu composición inaugural redujo a la audiencia a un amasijo balbuceante, "
"que murmuraba sobre brillantes criaturas descendiendo del cielo nocturno."
" Más tarde, notaste que las notas se parecían a constelaciones estelares."
" Tienes un libro de astronomía y muchas preguntas."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:73
msgid "Book On Astronomy"
msgstr "Libro de astronomía"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:79
msgid ""
"You mocked a forgotten trickster god and were cursed for it. You speak "
"only in perfect rhyme. Ironically, this has only made you more popular "
"among your peers. Take a Thesaurus (20gp). Without it, you are deprived."
msgstr ""
"Te burlaste de un olvidado dios de las mentiras y te maldijo por ello. "
"Solo puedes hablar en rima perfecta. Irónicamente, esto te ha hecho más "
"popular entre los tuyos. Tienes un tesauro (20 mo); si lo pierdes, quedas"
" Exhausto."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:82
msgid "Thesaurus"
msgstr "Tesauro"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:84
msgid "Worth 20gp. Without it you are deprived."
msgstr "Valor: 20 mo. Si lo pierdes, quedas Exhausto."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:89
msgid ""
"You were scarred in an on-stage accident. The crowd cheered, thinking it "
"was part of the act. Take well-worn Stage Mail (1 Armor), a memorable "
"scar, and a fear of applause."
msgstr ""
"Un accidente en el escenario te dejó una cicatriz. La multitud aplaudió, "
"pensando que era parte del acto. Tienes una cota de malla de atrezo "
"gastada (Armadura 1), una cicatriz memorable y miedo a los aplausos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:92
msgid "Stage Mail"
msgstr "Cota de malla de atrezo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:98
msgid ""
"Your respectable puppeteering skills were matched only by your mimicry. "
"You were so good you were branded a witch (literally) and banished. Take "
"an Uncanny Hand-Puppet and a Rabbit Skull (petty) that protects against "
"charms."
msgstr ""
"Tus dotes como titiritero solo eran superadas por tus capacidades como "
"imitador. Eras tan bueno que te marcaron como brujo (literalmente) y te "
"desterraron. Tienes una marioneta inquietante y un cráneo de conejo "
"(Insignificante) que te protege contra encantamientos de control."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:101
msgid "Uncanny Hand-Puppet"
msgstr "Marioneta inquietante"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:105
msgid "Rabbit Skull"
msgstr "Cráneo de conejo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:107
msgid "Protects against charms."
msgstr "Te protege contra encantamientos de control."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:114
msgid "What trinket were you unable to leave behind?"
msgstr "¿De qué baratija no te puedes desprender?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:117
msgid ""
"False Cuffs: Comfortable, realistic-looking cuffs. Only you know the "
"trick to get out of them."
msgstr ""
"Grilletes falsos: cómodos y de aspecto realista. Solo tú conoces el truco"
" para liberarte de ellos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:120
msgid "False Cuffs"
msgstr "Grilletes falsos"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:122
msgid ""
"Comfortable, realistic-looking cuffs. Only you know the trick to get out "
"of them."
msgstr ""
"Cómodos y de aspecto realista. Solo tú conoces el truco para liberarte de"
" ellos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:127
msgid ""
"Pocket Theatre: A set of small puppets and a folding stage. Good for "
"quick distractions."
msgstr ""
"Teatrillo de bolsillo: incluye un juego de marionetas pequeñas y un "
"escenario plegable. Bueno para distracciones rápidas."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:130
msgid "Pocket Theatre"
msgstr "Teatrillo de bolsillo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:132
msgid "A set of small puppets and a folding stage. Good for quick distractions."
msgstr ""
"Incluye un juego de marionetas pequeñas y un escenario plegable. Bueno "
"para distracciones rápidas."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:137
msgid ""
"Ghost Violin: A dark-grey violin that plays a haunting tune, mirrored by "
"an invisible, distant twin."
msgstr ""
"Violín espectral: un violín gris oscuro cuya inquietante melodía es "
"replicada por un gemelo invisible y distante."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:140
msgid "Ghost Violin"
msgstr "Violín espectral"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:142
msgid ""
"A dark-grey violin that plays a haunting tune, mirrored by an invisible, "
"distant twin."
msgstr ""
"Un violín gris oscuro cuya inquietante melodía es replicada por un gemelo"
" invisible y distante."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:147
msgid ""
"Tragic Tales: Banned in proper company, this book becomes less bawdy and "
"more harrowing towards the end. Worth 100gp."
msgstr ""
"Librillo de cuentos trágicos: prohibido en círculos respetables, este "
"libro se vuelve menos obsceno y más estremecedor hacia el final. Valor: "
"100 mo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:150
msgid "Tragic Tales"
msgstr "Librillo de cuentos trágicos"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:152
msgid ""
"Banned in proper company, it becomes less bawdy and more harrowing "
"towards the ends. Worth 100gp."
msgstr ""
"Prohibido en círculos respetables, se vuelve menos obsceno y más "
"estremecedor hacia el final. Valor: 100 mo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:157
msgid ""
"Mythos Mask: A plaster mask that allows one to take on a monster's "
"countenance. Once it comes off, add a Fatigue."
msgstr ""
"Máscara de mitos: una máscara de yeso que permite tomar la apariencia de "
"un monstruo. Cuando te la quites, ganas una Fatiga."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:160
msgid "Mythos Mask"
msgstr "Máscara de mitos"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:162
msgid ""
"A plaster mask that allows one to take on a monster's countenance. Once "
"it comes off, add a Fatigue."
msgstr ""
"Una máscara de yeso que permite tomar la apariencia de un monstruo. "
"Cuando te la quites, ganas una Fatiga."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:167
msgid ""
"Rebreak Glass: A wine flute that can be broken multiple times, reforming "
"after 24 hours. Makes a really loud noise."
msgstr ""
"Vidrio recuperable: una copa de vino que se puede romper varias veces y "
"se reconstruye después de 24 horas. Hace un ruido muy fuerte."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:170
msgid "Rebreak Glass"
msgstr "Vidrio recuperable"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/jongleur.json:172
msgid ""
"A wine flute that can be broken multiple times, reforming after 24 hours."
" Makes a really loud noise."
msgstr ""
"Una copa de vino que se puede romper varias veces y se reconstruye "
"después de 24 horas. Hace un ruido muy fuerte."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:4
msgid ""
"You are known by the smell of molten metal and the jingle of tin. You are"
" no mere merchant but an artisan of fire and metal."
msgstr ""
"Se te conoce por el olor a metal fundido y el tintineo de la hojalata. No"
" eres un simple comerciante, sino un artesano del fuego y el metal."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:20
msgid "Pincers"
msgstr "Tenazas"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:24
msgid "Roll of Tin"
msgstr "Rollo de hojalata"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:28
#: app/static/json/marketplace.json:1
msgid "Gloves"
msgstr "Guantes"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:32
#: app/static/json/hirelings.json:1
msgid "Hammer"
msgstr "Martillo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:37
msgid "What is your trade?"
msgstr "¿A qué te dedicas?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:40
msgid ""
"You build small contraptions for local guilds (and don't ask too many "
"questions). Take an extra 40gp and a wanted poster with your face on it. "
"Given time and materials, you can open almost any door or vault."
msgstr ""
"Creas pequeños artilugios para los gremios locales (y no haces demasiadas"
" preguntas al respecto). Tienes 40 mo extra y un cartel de «Se busca» con"
" tu cara. Con tiempo y materiales, puedes abrir casi cualquier puerta o "
"cámara acorazada."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:45
msgid ""
"You deal in home goods and tools, hawking your wares to townspeople "
"across the lands. Take 20gp worth of items from the gear table. You are "
"fluent in the Traveler's Cant."
msgstr ""
"Te dedicas a vender artículos para el hogar y herramientas varias, "
"pregonando tus productos a los habitantes de los pueblos por todas las "
"regiones. Tienes 20 mo en artículos de la tabla de equipo. Hablas con "
"fluidez el argot de los viajeros."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:47
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:125
msgid "gear_table"
msgstr ""

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:50
msgid ""
"You were a military smelter, before peace destroyed your livelihood. Take"
" a smelting hammer (d10, bulky) and a tin helm (+1 Armor). Given time and"
" adequate materials, you can repair armor."
msgstr ""
"Eras un armero militar, antes de que la paz destruyera tu sustento. "
"Tienes un martillo de fundición (d10, Voluminoso) y un yelmo de hojalata "
"(+1 Armadura). Con el tiempo y los materiales adecuados, puedes reparar "
"cualquier armadura."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:53
msgid "Smelting Hammer"
msgstr "Martillo de fundición"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:55
msgid "Given time and adequate materials, you can repair armor."
msgstr ""
"Con el tiempo y los materiales adecuados, puedes reparar cualquier "
"armadura."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:58
msgid "Tin Helm"
msgstr "Yelmo de hojalata"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:64
msgid ""
"You sell rare and quality items to monasteries and nobles alike. Take a "
"Spyglass, a Necklace (petty) worth 20gp, and a Scroll of Mirrorwalk "
"(petty)."
msgstr ""
"Vendes artículos raros y de calidad, tanto a monasterios como a nobles. "
"Tienes un catalejo, un collar (Insignificante) valorado en 20 mo y un "
"pergamino de Puerta espejo (Insignificante)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:67
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:43
#: app/static/json/marketplace.json:1
msgid "Spyglass"
msgstr "Catalejo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:71
msgid "Necklace"
msgstr "Collar"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:73
msgid "Worth 20gp."
msgstr "Valorado en 20 mo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:76
msgid "Scroll (Mirrorwalk)"
msgstr "Pergamino (Puerta espejo)"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:78
#: app/static/json/generators/spellbooks.json:1
#: app/static/json/party_events/spellbooks.json:330
msgid "A mirror becomes a gateway to another mirror that you looked into today."
msgstr ""
"Conviertes un espejo en una puerta que conduce a otro espejo donde te "
"hayas mirado hoy."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:83
msgid ""
"You offer protection as a service, quietly watching for threats as money "
"exchanges hands. You start with +d4 HP, and carry a Long Sword (d10, "
"bulky) and a Gambeson (+1 Armor)."
msgstr ""
"Ofreces protección; vigilas silenciosamente en busca de amenazas mientras"
" el dinero cambia de manos. Comienzas con +d4 PG y tienes una espada "
"larga (d10, Voluminosa) y un gambesón (+1 Armadura)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:86
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:34
#: app/static/json/marketplace.json:1
msgid "Long Sword"
msgstr "Espada larga"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:90
#: app/static/json/hirelings.json:1 app/static/json/marketplace.json:1
msgid "Gambeson"
msgstr "Gambesón"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:96
msgid ""
"You scavenge raw tin and iron from battlefields, pulling teeth from "
"still-twitching corpses. Start with a young Donkey (+4 slots, slow), a "
"Crossbow (d8 damage, bulky), and a Saw (d6)."
msgstr ""
"Recoges estaño y hierro de los campos de batalla, arrancando dientes de "
"cadáveres aún temblorosos. Tienes un burro joven (+4 espacios, lento), "
"una ballesta (d8 de daño, Voluminosa) y una sierra (d6)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:103
msgid "Saw"
msgstr "Sierra"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:117
msgid "What never fails to get you out of trouble?"
msgstr "¿Cuál de tus pertenencias siempre te saca de problemas?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:120
msgid ""
"Fire Eggs: Six small pellets made of sea salt, wood, and crockery-dust. "
"They explode at low heat (d8, blast) but the flames dissipate quickly."
msgstr ""
"Huevos de fuego: seis pequeñas bolitas hechas de sal marina, madera y "
"polvo de loza. Explotan a baja temperatura (d8, Estallido), pero las "
"llamas se disipan rápidamente."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:123
msgid "Fire Eggs"
msgstr "Huevos de fuego"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/kettlewright.json:125
msgid ""
"Six small pellets made of sea salt, wood, and crockery-dust. They explode"
" at low heat but the flames dissipate quickly."
msgstr ""
"Seis pequeñas bolitas hechas de sal marina, madera y polvo de loza. "
"Explotan a baja temperatura, pero las llamas se disipan rápidamente."

