#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:43
msgid "Why did you take the Oath?"
msgstr "¿Por qué decidiste hacer el juramento?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:46
msgid ""
"Your family has a long tradition of serving, and you were trained from an"
" early age on how to survive in the wild. When taking the Supply action, "
"your yield increases by one step (e.g. 1d4 > 1d6)."
msgstr ""
"Tu familia tiene una larga tradición de servicio, y fuiste entrenado "
"desde pequeño en cómo sobrevivir en la naturaleza. Al realizar la acción "
"de supervivencia Forrajear, tu rendimiento aumenta en un paso (por "
"ejemplo, de 1d4 a 1d6)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:49
msgid ""
"As a convict, the Oath was simply a means of avoiding punishment. Take a "
"set of Lockpicks and the key (petty) to a safehouse."
msgstr ""
"Como convicto, hacer el juramento era un medio de evitar tu castigo. "
"Tienes un juego de ganzúas y una llave (Insignificante) de un refugio "
"seguro."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:56
msgid "Safehouse Key"
msgstr "Llave de un refugio seguro"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:62
msgid ""
"Noble-born, you joined to escape family trouble. Take a Goosefelt Tarp "
"(fits two) that you stole before leaving home."
msgstr ""
"Siendo noble de nacimiento, te uniste para escapar de los problemas "
"familiares. Tienes una lona de plumas de ganso (para dos personas) que "
"robaste al irte de casa."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:65
msgid "Goosefelt Tarp"
msgstr "Lona de plumas de ganso"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:67
msgid "Fits 2."
msgstr "Para dos personas."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:72
msgid ""
"When your family lost everything, you took the Oath to avoid becoming a "
"burden. Take extra Rations (3 uses) and a brace of Throwing Knives (d6)."
msgstr ""
"Cuando tu familia lo perdió todo, hiciste el juramento para evitar "
"convertirte en una carga. Tienes raciones extra (3 usos) y cuchillos "
"arrojadizos (d6)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:81
msgid "Throwing Knives"
msgstr "Cuchillos arrojadizos"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:87
msgid ""
"Your life was saved by a member of the Marchguard, and you were inspired "
"to join their ranks. Take a Snare Trap and a Sketchbook filled with "
"detailed drawings."
msgstr ""
"Tu vida fue salvada por un miembro de la Guardia Fronteriza, y eso te "
"inspiró a unirte a sus filas. Tienes una trampa de lazo y un cuaderno de "
"bocetos lleno de dibujos detallados."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:90
msgid "Snare Trap"
msgstr "Trampa de lazo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:94
msgid "Sketchbook"
msgstr "Cuaderno de bocetos"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:100
msgid ""
"You were in a dark place and decided that your life needed a little "
"direction. You're still not so sure it was the right choice. Take an "
"Oilskin Coat and Mapping Paper."
msgstr ""
"Estabas en un lugar oscuro y decidiste que tu vida necesitaba un poco de "
"disciplina. Aún no estás seguro de que haya sido la elección correcta. "
"Tienes un abrigo de tela encerada y papel para mapear."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:103
msgid "Oilskin Coat"
msgstr "Abrigo de tela encerada"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:107
msgid "Mapping Paper"
msgstr "Papel para mapear"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:115
msgid "What do you carry as proof of your Oath?"
msgstr "¿Qué portas como recordatorio de tu juramento?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:118
msgid ""
"Impressive Pin: A metal badge of honor from the Guard. It can open doors "
"but leaves a trail. Petty."
msgstr ""
"Insignia imponente: insignia de metal de honor de la Guardia. Puede "
"abrirte puertas, pero siempre deja un rastro. Insignificante."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:121
msgid "Impressive Pin"
msgstr "Insignia imponente"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:123
msgid ""
"A metal badge of honor from the Guard. It can open doors but leaves a "
"trail."
msgstr ""
"Insignia de metal de honor de la Guardia. Puede abrirte puertas, pero "
"siempre deja un rastro."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:128
msgid ""
"Oath Compass: Points not towards North, but instead to the nearest member"
" of the Guard. It also lets you know when they're getting close."
msgstr ""
"Brújula de juramento: no apunta al norte, sino al integrante de la "
"Guardia más cercano. También te permite saber cuándo se acercan a tu "
"posición."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:131
msgid "Oath Compass"
msgstr "Brújula de juramento"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:137
msgid ""
"Pullstones: Two jet-black stones. When separated, the stones will always "
"roll toward one another."
msgstr ""
"Piedras de atracción: dos piedras negras como el azabache. Cuando se "
"separan, siempre ruedan una hacia la otra."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:140
msgid "Pullstones"
msgstr "Piedras de atracción"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:142
msgid ""
"Two jet-black stones. When separated, the stones will always roll toward "
"one another."
msgstr ""
"Dos piedras negras como el azabache. Cuando se separan, siempre ruedan "
"una hacia la otra."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:147
msgid ""
"Fireflask: Highly alcoholic, yet strangely delicious. When thrown, it "
"creates a wall of flames 10ft high that burns out after a few minutes. 1 "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Vial de fuego: altamente alcohólico, pero extrañamente delicioso. Cuando "
"se lanza, crea un muro de llamas de 3 metros de altura que se apaga "
"después de unos minutos. 1 uso."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:150
msgid "Fireflask"
msgstr "Vial de fuego"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:152
msgid ""
"Highly alcoholic, yet strangely delicious. When thrown, it creates a wall"
" of flames 10ft high that burns out after a few minutes. 1 use."
msgstr ""
"Altamente alcohólico, pero extrañamente delicioso. Cuando se lanza, crea "
"un muro de llamas de 3 metros de altura que se apaga después de unos "
"minutos. 1 uso."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:157
msgid ""
"Pain Band: Touch an injured creature to transfer their wounds to you. "
"(Exchange their lost STR with your own.) Recharge: Wear the ring while in"
" perfect health. You will lose 1 STR, permanently. Petty."
msgstr ""
"Anillo de dolor: toca a una criatura herida para transferirte sus heridas"
" (intercambia su FUE perdida con la tuya). Recarga: usa el anillo "
"mientras estás completamente sano. Perderás 1 punto de FUE "
"permanentemente. Insignificante."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:160
msgid "Pain Band"
msgstr "Anillo de dolor"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:164
msgid ""
"Touch an injured creature to transfer their wounds to you. (Exchange "
"their lost STR with your own.) Recharge: Wear the ring while in perfect "
"health. You will lose 1 STR, permanently."
msgstr ""
"Toca a una criatura herida para transferirte sus heridas (intercambia su "
"FUE perdida con la tuya). Recarga: usa el anillo mientras estás "
"completamente sano. Perderás 1 punto de FUE permanentemente."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:169
msgid ""
"Poacher's Woe: Strongly-scented arrows (3 uses). The scent is powerful "
"enough to track with ease."
msgstr ""
"Desdicha cazadora: flechas de fuerte olor (3 usos). El aroma es lo "
"suficientemente potente como para rastrearlas fácilmente."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/marchguard.json:172
msgid "Poacher's Woe"
msgstr "Desdicha cazadora"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:4
msgid ""
"Wits are your sharpest weapon, a facade your strongest shield. But when "
"you do lose, you lose badly."
msgstr ""
"Tu ingenio es tu arma más afilada; una fachada, tu escudo más fuerte. "
"Pero cuando fallas, lo pierdes todo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:31
msgid "Trick Playing Cards"
msgstr "Naipes trucados"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:35
msgid "Fancy Hat"
msgstr "Sombrero fino"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:39
msgid "Cane Sword"
msgstr "Espada de bastón"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:45
msgid "Cart"
msgstr "Carreta"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:47
msgid "main"
msgstr ""

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:52
msgid "How was your fraud exposed?"
msgstr "¿Cómo quedaron expuestos tus engaños?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:55
msgid ""
"Your 'patients' kept reporting miraculous recoveries, despite your lack "
"of training. Start with Bandages (3 uses) and a knack for healing."
msgstr ""
"Tus «pacientes» dijeron que se recuperaron milagrosamente, a pesar de tu "
"falta de conocimientos médicos. Tienes vendajes (3 usos) y una habilidad "
"innata para curar."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:65
msgid ""
"After seducing a wealthy patron, their family hired a criminal gang to "
"retrieve you. You got away and need to lay low. Start with Beauty Cream, "
"2 uses. Apply to appear irresistibly beautiful for the next 12 hours."
msgstr ""
"Tras seducir a una persona adinerada, su familia contrató a una banda de "
"criminales para capturarte. Has escapado y necesitas ocultarte. Tienes "
"una crema embellecedora (2 usos). Úsala para ganar una belleza "
"irresistible durante las próximas 12 horas."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:68
msgid "Beauty Cream"
msgstr "Crema embellecedora"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:75
msgid ""
"You were a peddler of fake prophesies, but when one turned out to be "
"true, it drew unwanted attention. Roll on the Omens table, but keep the "
"result to yourself. Start with a concealable Knife (d6, petty)."
msgstr ""
"Solías vender profecías falsas, pero cuando una de ellas resultó ser "
"cierta, atrajiste atención no deseada. Tira en la tabla de Presagios, "
"pero no le digas a nadie el resultado que obtengas. Tienes un cuchillo "
"ocultable (d6, Insignificante)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:78
msgid "Knife"
msgstr "Cuchillo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:80
msgid "Concealable."
msgstr "Ocultable."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:85
msgid ""
"Your latest stunt destroyed a priceless artifact and injured a dozen "
"bystanders. Start with a Captain's Uniform (petty), a Ceremonial Sword "
"(harmless, 60gp), and a Bouquet of Flowers."
msgstr ""
"Tu última hazaña destruyó un artefacto invaluable y lesionó a una docena "
"de transeúntes. Tienes un uniforme de capitán (Insignificante), una "
"espada ceremonial (Inofensiva, 60 mo) y un ramo de flores."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:88
msgid "Captain's Uniform"
msgstr "Uniforme de capitán"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:92
msgid "Ceremonial Sword"
msgstr "Espada ceremonial"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:94
msgid "Harmless, worth 60gp"
msgstr "Inofensiva, valorada en 60 mo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:97
msgid "Bouquet of Flowers"
msgstr "Ramo de flores"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:103
msgid ""
"You were cursed by a hedgewitch for fooling some innocent village folk. "
"Magic acts unpredictably in your hands (WIL save to avoid disaster). If "
"you are the target of magic, the same applies to its wielder."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste maldecido por una bruja del seto por engañar a algunos aldeanos "
"inocentes. La magia actúa de manera impredecible en tus manos (Salvación "
"de VOL para evitar el caos). Si eres el objetivo de la magia, lo mismo se"
" aplica a quien la maneje."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:107
msgid ""
"Your 'seances' with the dead were in actuality a ruse involving a "
"cleverly hidden spellbook of Auditory Illusion. Inevitably, a patron "
"discovered your secret. Start with the Spellbook and a bundle of scarves."
msgstr ""
"Tus «sesiones espiritistas» eran en realidad un engaño que involucraba un"
" Libro de Hechizos de Ilusión auditiva hábilmente oculto. "
"Inevitablemente, un cliente descubrió tu secreto. Tienes el Libro de "
"Hechizos y un fajo de pañuelos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:110
msgid "Spellbook (Auditory Illusion)"
msgstr "Libro de Hechizos (Ilusión auditiva)"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:112
msgid ""
"You create illusory sounds that seem to come from a direction of your "
"choice. Produces random and occasionally inopportune sounds throughout "
"the day."
msgstr ""
"Creas sonidos ilusorios que parecen provenir de una dirección a tu "
"elección. Produce sonidos aleatorios y ocasionalmente inoportunos a lo "
"largo del día."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:119
msgid "What keepsake could always identify you?"
msgstr "¿Qué objeto entre tus pertenencias puede delatarte?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:122
msgid ""
"Royal Crest: Born into royalty, you chose a different life. The Royal "
"Crest grants you access but also alerts your family of your whereabouts. "
"Petty."
msgstr ""
"Emblema real: nacido en la realeza, elegiste una vida diferente. El "
"emblema te abre muchas puertas, pero al mismo tiempo alerta a tu familia "
"sobre tu paradero. Insignificante."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:125
msgid "Royal Crest"
msgstr "Emblema real"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:127
msgid ""
"Born into royalty, you chose a different life. The Royal Crest grants you"
" access but also alerts your family of your whereabouts."
msgstr ""
"Nacido en la realeza, elegiste una vida diferente. El emblema te abre "
"muchas puertas, pero al mismo tiempo alerta a tu familia sobre tu "
"paradero."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:132
msgid "Miracle Oil: A smelly, slippery concoction. 2 uses."
msgstr "Aceite milagroso: una mezcla maloliente y resbaladiza. 2 usos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:135
msgid "Miracle Oil"
msgstr "Aceite milagroso"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:142
msgid ""
"Surgeon's Soap: A lye and ash block that makes skin temporarily "
"transparent, revealing the anatomy within. 4 uses."
msgstr ""
"Jabón de cirujano: un bloque de lejía y ceniza que hace que la piel se "
"vuelva temporalmente transparente y revela la anatomía interna. 4 usos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:145
msgid "Surgeon's Soap"
msgstr "Jabón de cirujano"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:152
msgid ""
"Goat Powder: Derived from the placenta of a baby goat. Temporarily cures "
"any affliction, but symptoms return within hours."
msgstr ""
"Polvo de cabra: hecho con placenta obtenida del alumbramiento de un "
"cabrito. Cura temporalmente cualquier enfermedad, pero los síntomas "
"regresan a las pocas horas."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:155
msgid "Goat Powder"
msgstr "Polvo de cabra"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:161
msgid ""
"Cursed Sapphire: Worth 200gp, it noticeably returns to your pocket "
"shortly after you spend it. You can't seem to get rid of it."
msgstr ""
"Zafiro maldito: vale 200 mo. Regresa a tu bolsillo poco después de "
"gastarlo. No te puedes deshacer de él."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:164
msgid "Cursed Sapphire"
msgstr "Zafiro maldito"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:170 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid ""
"Alchemical Tattoo: A dog, cat, or bird that can leave your body on "
"demand. It follows your commands to the best of its abilities and can "
"pass its injuries (as STR loss) back onto you. Petty."
msgstr ""
"Tatuaje alquímico: tienes tatuado un perro, gato o pájaro que puede "
"abandonar tu cuerpo cuando se lo pidas. Sigue tus órdenes lo mejor que "
"puede y te transmite las heridas que recibe haciéndote perder puntos de "
"FUE. Insignificante."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/mountebank.json:173 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid "Alchemical Tattoo"
msgstr "Tatuaje alquímico"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:4
msgid ""
"Your coin comes from escorting caravans, tracking fugitives, or lending "
"your blade to a cause. You've been a savior, an executioner, a hero, and "
"even a villain. Yours is not a solitary path, however: you'll always have"
" your horse."
msgstr ""
"Tus ingresos provienen de proteger caravanas, rastrear fugitivos o "
"prestar tu espada a una causa. Has sido una salvadora, una verduga, una "
"heroína e incluso una villana. Sin embargo, tu camino no es solitario: "
"siempre tendrás a tu caballo a tu lado."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:31
msgid "Long sword"
msgstr "Espada larga"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:35
msgid "Leather jerkin"
msgstr "Jubón de cuero"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:48
msgid "What personal code or principle do you uphold?"
msgstr "¿Qué principio rige tu vida?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:51
msgid ""
"No innocent blood: No bystander will come to harm on your watch. Take a "
"Steadymade Buckler (+1 Armor). While holding this shield, you cannot be "
"moved so long as both feet are planted on firm ground."
msgstr ""
"No derramar sangre inocente: ningún testigo sufrirá daño bajo tu "
"presencia. Tienes una rodela hecha a la medida (+1 Armadura). Mientras la"
" sostengas, nadie puede moverte siempre que tengas ambos pies plantados "
"en suelo firme."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:54
msgid "Steadymade Buckler"
msgstr "Rodela hecha a la medida"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:56
msgid ""
"While holding this shield, you cannot be moved so long as both feet are "
"planted on firm ground."
msgstr ""
"Mientras la sostengas, nadie puede moverte siempre que tengas ambos pies "
"plantados en suelo firme."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:61
msgid ""
"Revere the tools of death: Weapons are to be respected and maintained. "
"Take a Wyrmbone Whetstone. Following a half-hour ritual sharpening, "
"attacks with the weapon are enhanced until STR damage is dealt."
msgstr ""
"Venerar las herramientas de la muerte: las armas deben ser respetadas y "
"cuidadas meticulosamente. Tienes una piedra de afilar de hueso de dragón."
" Tras un ritual de afilado de media hora, los ataques con el arma tienen "
"Ventaja hasta que provocan daño a FUE."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:64
msgid "Wyrmbone Whetstone"
msgstr "Piedra de afilar de hueso de dragón"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:66
msgid ""
"Following a half-hour ritual sharpening, attacks with the weapon are "
"enhanced until STR damage is dealt."
msgstr ""
"Tras un ritual de afilado de media hora, los ataques con el arma tienen "
"Ventaja hasta que provocan daño a FUE."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:71
msgid ""
"To the death, always: You never back down from a fight, no matter the "
"odds. Take a Death-Whistle, 1 charge. Its scream frightens away all who "
"hear it (save WIL or flee). Recharge: Capture the final breath of a dying"
" warrior."
msgstr ""
"Hasta la muerte, siempre: nunca retrocedes en una pelea, sin importar tus"
" probabilidades. Tienes un silbato de la muerte, 1 carga. Su sonido "
"asusta a todos los que lo oyen (Salvación de VOL o huyen). Recarga: "
"captura el último aliento de un guerrero moribundo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:74
msgid "Death-Whistle"
msgstr "Silbato de la muerte"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:78
msgid ""
"Its scream frightens away all who hear it (save WIL or flee). Recharge: "
"Capture the final breath of a dying warrior."
msgstr ""
"Su sonido asusta a todos los que lo oyen (Salvación de VOL o huyen). "
"Recarga: captura el último aliento de un guerrero moribundo."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:83
msgid ""
"Revere the dead: Death is a journey we all take, and it deserves respect."
" Take an extra 30gp. You always place two gold pieces on the eyelids of a"
" slain foe. Somehow, you always find the coin."
msgstr ""
"Respeta a los muertos: la muerte es un viaje que todos emprendemos y "
"merece respeto. Tienes 30 mo adicionales. Siempre colocas dos piezas de "
"oro en los párpados de un enemigo abatido. De alguna manera, siempre "
"vuelven a ti."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:88
msgid ""
"Loyalty to the work: Your word is your bond. Once you've accepted a job, "
"you see it through to the end. Take a weathered Tally Stick. Once a vow "
"is marked onto its face, the stick hardens (d8) until it is complete. The"
" stick will snap in half if the vow is ever broken."
msgstr ""
"Cumple tu palabra: tu palabra lo es todo. Una vez que has aceptado un "
"trabajo, no lo sueltas hasta que lo terminas. Tienes un palo de cuentas "
"viejo. Una vez que un juramento se marque en su superficie, el palo se "
"endurece (d8) hasta que se complete. El palo se romperá en dos si el "
"juramento es roto."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:91
msgid "Tally Stick"
msgstr "Palo de cuentas"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:93
msgid ""
"Once a vow is marked onto its face, the stick hardens (d8) until it is "
"complete. The stick will snap in half if the vow is ever broken."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que un juramento se marque en su superficie, el palo se endurece "
"(d8) hasta que se complete. El palo se romperá en dos si el juramento es "
"roto."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:98
msgid ""
"Always pay your debts: You always repay what you owe, whether in coin or "
"in kind. You expect nothing less from all others. Take a Blacked-Out "
"Ledger, then roll a second time on the Bonds table."
msgstr ""
"Paga tus deudas siempre: devuelves lo que debes, ya sea en monedas o en "
"especie. No esperas menos de los demás. Tienes un libro de registros "
"negruzco, y tira otra vez en la tabla de Vínculos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:101
msgid "Blacked-Out Ledger"
msgstr "Libro de registros negruzco"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:109
msgid "What breed is your horse?"
msgstr "¿De qué raza es tu caballo?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:112 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid ""
"Heavy Destrier: A beast built for war, an imposing creature. 8 HP, 1 "
"Armor, hooves (d10+d10), +2 slots."
msgstr ""
"Destrero pesado: una bestia hecha para la guerra, una criatura imponente."
" PG 8, Armadura 1, pezuñas (d10+d10), +2 espacios."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:115 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid "Heavy Destrier"
msgstr "Destrero pesado"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:121 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid ""
"Blacklegged Dandy: Hardy and adaptable. Tough or Perilous terrain are one"
" step easier. 6 HP. +4 slots."
msgstr ""
"Dandi patinegro: resistente y adaptable. Los terrenos Duros o Peligrosos "
"se vuelven un paso más fáciles. PG 6, +4 espacios."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:124 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid "Blacklegged Dandy"
msgstr "Dandi patinegro"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:130 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid ""
"Rivertooth: Impressively strong, capable of carrying heavy loads. 4 HP. "
"+6 slots (only +2 slots if carrying two people)."
msgstr ""
"Colmillo firme: impresionantemente fuerte, capaz de transportar cargas "
"pesadas. PG 4, +6 espacios (solo +2 espacios si transporta a dos "
"personas)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:133 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid "Rivertooth"
msgstr "Colmillo firme"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:139 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid ""
"Piebald Cob: Intelligent, it can understand simple commands, and even has"
" an instinct for danger. 6 HP. +4 slots."
msgstr ""
"Cob Pío: inteligente, puede entender órdenes sencillas e incluso tiene "
"instinto para el peligro. PG 6, +4 espacios."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:142 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid "Piebald Cob"
msgstr "Cob Pío"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:148 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid ""
"Linden White: Highly trained and agile, it can perform intricate "
"maneuvers in a time of need (no DEX save to flee). 4 HP. +3 slots."
msgstr ""
"Pálido de Linden: altamente entrenado y ágil, puede realizar maniobras "
"complejas en momentos de necesidad (no requiere Salvación de DES para "
"huir). PG 4, +3 espacios."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:151 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid "Linden White"
msgstr "Pálido de Linden"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:157 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid ""
"Stray Fogger: Wild but very fast (even in Tough terrain). Rides light. 4 "
"HP. +2 slots."
msgstr ""
"Niebla errante: salvaje pero muy rápido, incluso en terrenos duros. "
"Montura ligera. PG 4, +2 espacios."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/outrider.json:160 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid "Stray Fogger"
msgstr "Niebla errante"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:4
msgid ""
"You are a specter in the night, a fleeting shadow that slips by its prey,"
" unseen. Each kill is a test of cunning and animal determination, a "
"contest between life and death. You know that one day you will lose. You "
"look forward to it."
msgstr ""
"Eres un espectro en la noche, una sombra fugaz que se desliza junto a su "
"presa, invisible. Cada asesinato es una prueba de astucia y determinación"
" animal, una lucha entre la vida y la muerte. Sabes que un día no te "
"saldrás con la tuya. Lo esperas con ansias."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:31
msgid "Tarp"
msgstr "Lona"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:39
msgid "Short Sword"
msgstr "Espada corta"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:43
msgid "Spring-Loaded Trap"
msgstr "Trampa de resorte"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:45
msgid "4 STR damage"
msgstr "4 de daño a FUE"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:49
msgid "What did you last hunt?"
msgstr "¿Qué fue lo último que cazaste?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:52
msgid ""
"A mock firefly, baiting water carriers with its glowing lure. Take an "
"Alchemical Limb (d8, petty when worn) to replace the one it tore off and "
"an Oil Can (6 uses). The limb is immune to heat and poison. Needs to be "
"oiled daily."
msgstr ""
"Una luciérnaga falsa, que atraía a los acarreadores de agua con su cebo "
"luminoso. Tienes una extremidad alquímica (d8, Insignificante cuando se "
"usa) para reemplazar la que te arrancó, y una lata de aceite (6 usos). La"
" extremidad es inmune al calor y al veneno. Necesita ser engrasada "
"diariamente."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:55
msgid "Alchemical Limb"
msgstr "Extremidad alquímica"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:57
msgid "Immune to heat and poison. Needs to be oiled daily. Petty when worn."
msgstr ""
"Inmune al calor y al veneno. Necesita ser engrasada diariamente. "
"Insignificante cuando se usa."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:67
msgid ""
"An ice nettle, trapping and draining sheep. You lost your commission when"
" the fungus you introduced killed half the flock. Take a Rime Seed (1 "
"use). It freezes any body of water, no matter the size. Don't eat it."
msgstr ""
"Una ortiga de hielo, que atrapaba y absorbía la fuerza vital de las "
"ovejas. Perdiste tu paga porque el hongo que usaste para matarla terminó "
"matando a la mitad del rebaño. Tienes una semilla de hielo (1 uso). "
"Congela cualquier cuerpo de agua, sin importar el tamaño. ¡No te "
"arriesgues a comerla!"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:70
msgid "Rime Seed"
msgstr "Semilla de hielo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:73
msgid "Freezes any body of water, no matter the size. Don't eat it."
msgstr ""
"Congela cualquier cuerpo de agua, sin importar el tamaño. ¡No te "
"arriesgues a comerla!"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:78
msgid ""
"A silver marsh crawler that killed someone close to you. You now carry "
"its Tooth (petty) on a chain around your neck as a warning to others of "
"its kind. The tooth hums softly when something is stalking you."
msgstr ""
"Un rastrero de la ciénaga plateada que mató a un ser querido. Ahora "
"llevas su diente (Insignificante) en una cadena alrededor del cuello, "
"como advertencia a otros de su especie. El diente vibra ligeramente "
"cuando algo te acecha."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:81
msgid "Tooth"
msgstr "Diente"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:83
msgid ""
"The Tooth of a Silver Marsh Crawler, carried as a warning to others of "
"its kind. Hums softly when something is stalking you."
msgstr ""
"El diente de un rastrero de la ciénaga plateada, que llevas como "
"advertencia a otros de su especie. Vibra ligeramente cuando algo te "
"acecha."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:88
msgid ""
"A malicious forest spirit that poisoned a homestead. You saved a "
"Heartseed from the roots of a dying tree (plant to create a a new "
"forest). Also, take Iron Bracers (+1 Armor, bulky)."
msgstr ""
"Un espíritu malicioso del bosque que envenenó una granja. Has recuperado "
"una semilla corazón de las raíces de un árbol moribundo (plántala para "
"crear un nuevo bosque). Además, tienes brazaletes de hierro (+1 Armadura,"
" Voluminosos)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:91
msgid "Heartseed"
msgstr "Semilla corazón"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:93
msgid "Plant it to create a new forest."
msgstr "Plántala para crear un nuevo bosque."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:96
msgid "Iron Bracers"
msgstr "Brazaletes de hierro"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:102 app/static/json/pets.json:1
msgid ""
"A hollow wolf that had been frightening travelers. You took pity on the "
"half-starved creature and nursed it back to health. Now it is loyal to "
"you unto death. It is also a great tunneler. 5 HP, 11 STR, 13 DEX, 8 WIL,"
" teeth (d6)."
msgstr ""
"Un lobo hueco que había estado asustando a viajantes. Te apiadaste de la "
"criatura, que estaba muerta de hambre, y la cuidaste hasta que se "
"recuperó. Ahora te es leal hasta la muerte. Es un gran excavador. PG 5, "
"FUE 11, DES 13, VOL 8, dientes (d6)."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:106
msgid ""
"An azure warbler. The gametes attract a sizeable profit, if properly "
"extracted. You succeeded but left its nest to the wolves. Take a Paring "
"Knife (d6), an extra 20gp, and a pang of regret."
msgstr ""
"Un azul trinador. Sus gametos se pagan muy bien, si son extraídos con el "
"debido cuidado. Tuviste éxito, pero dejaste su nido a los lobos. Tienes "
"un cuchillo de pelar (d6), 20 mo extra y una terrible sensación de "
"arrepentimiento."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:109
msgid "Paring Knife"
msgstr "Cuchillo de pelar"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:118
msgid "What tool is always in your pack?"
msgstr "¿Qué herramienta está siempre en tu mochila?"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:121
msgid ""
"Fermented Spirits: Keeps you warm at the best of times and as an "
"explosive at the worst. 3 Uses."
msgstr ""
"Licor añejado: te mantiene caliente en los mejores momentos y puede "
"usarse como explosivo en los peores. 3 usos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:124
msgid "Fermented Spirits"
msgstr "Licor añejado"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:127
msgid "Keeps you warm at the best of times and as an explosive at the worst."
msgstr ""
"Te mantiene caliente en los mejores momentos y puede usarse como "
"explosivo en los peores."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:132
msgid ""
"Trail Shaker: A noisy instrument that reveals nearby trails, even when "
"deeply hidden."
msgstr ""
"Marcador de rastro: un instrumento ruidoso que revela rastros cercanos, "
"incluso cuando están ocultos."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:135
msgid "Trail Shaker"
msgstr "Marcador de rastro"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/prowler.json:137
msgid "A noisy instrument that reveals nearby trails, even when deeply hidden."
msgstr ""
