"Cualquiera que esté al alcance de su silbido debe superar una Salvación "
"de VOL si pretende realizar una acción violenta."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:50
msgid ""
"The Sylph and Her Lover. A bawdy tale of lost love. Start with a Breeze "
"Knot (3 charges). Creates a strong breeze. Recharge: Tie it to a mast "
"during a storm."
msgstr ""
"La sílfide y su amante. Narra la atrevida historia del espíritu y su amor"
" perdido. Tienes un nudo de brisa (3 cargas). Crea una fuerte brisa a "
"voluntad. Recarga: átalo a un mástil durante una tormenta."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:53
msgid "Breeze Knot"
msgstr "Nudo de brisa"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:57
msgid "Creates a strong breeze. Recharge: Tie it to a mast during a storm."
msgstr ""
"Crea una fuerte brisa a voluntad. Recarga: átalo a un mástil durante una "
"tormenta."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:62
msgid ""
"Harper's Devotion. A sad, short tale about a musician who falls in love "
"with a star. Start with a Celestial Lute. Reveals the constellations "
"above, no matter the weather."
msgstr ""
"La devoción de Harper. Narra la triste y corta historia de un músico que "
"se enamoró de una estrella. Tienes un laúd azul cielo. Revela las "
"constelaciones, sin importar el clima que haga."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:65
msgid "Celestial Lute"
msgstr "Laúd azul cielo"

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:67
msgid "Reveals the constellations above, no matter the weather."
msgstr "Revela las constelaciones, sin importar el clima que haga."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:72
msgid ""
"The Reed Fisher. A celebrated song about a massive carp that always seems"
" to get away. Begin with a spool of River Twine (5 uses). Each dip into "
"the river guarantees a catch, though it might not be pleasant."
msgstr ""
"La carpa pescadora. Una célebre canción sobre una enorme carpa que "
"siempre parece escabullirse. Tienes un carrete de hilo de pesca (5 usos)."
" Cada zambullida en el río garantiza una captura, aunque puede que lo que"
" captures no sea agradable."

#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:1
#: app/static/json/backgrounds/rill-runner.json:75
