msgstr "Conectar cuenta"

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:15
msgid "Connected as"
msgstr "Conectado como"

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:17
msgid "Disconnecting resets your Discord setup."
msgstr "Desconectar reinicia tu configuración de Discord."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:18
msgid ""
"This removes your character selections and every channel binding you "
"created, including other players’ selections in those channels. After "
"reconnecting, you will need to bind the channels and players will need to"
" select their characters again."
msgstr ""
"Se eliminan tus selecciones de personaje y todos los vínculos de canal "
"que creaste, incluidas las selecciones de otros jugadores en esos "
"canales. Al reconectar, deberás vincular los canales y los jugadores "
"volver a elegir sus personajes."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:22
msgid "Disconnect Discord"
msgstr "Desconectar Discord"

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:25
msgid ""
"Connect the Discord account you will use for Kettlewright commands. Each "
"Warden and player connects their own account."
msgstr ""
"Conecta la cuenta Discord que usarás para los comandos de Kettlewright. "
"Cada Guardiana y jugador conecta su propia cuenta."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:28
msgid "Connect Discord"
msgstr "Conectar Discord"

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:31
msgid "Discord integration is not configured on this server yet."
msgstr "La integración con Discord aún no está configurada en este servidor."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:34
msgid "Sign in to connect your Kettlewright and Discord accounts."
msgstr "Inicia sesión para conectar tus cuentas Kettlewright y Discord."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:41
msgid "For the Warden"
msgstr "Para la Guardiana"

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:43
msgid "Add the Kettlewright app to your Discord server"
msgstr "Añadir la aplicación Kettlewright a tu servidor Discord"

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:44
msgid ""
"Connect your Discord account to Kettlewright using the button above. You "
"must own the party in Kettlewright and have Manage Channels or "
"Administrator permission in Discord."
msgstr ""
"Conecta Discord con Kettlewright mediante el botón de arriba. Debes ser "
"dueño del grupo en Kettlewright y tener permiso de gestionar canales o "
"administrador en Discord."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:45
msgid ""
"In each channel you want to use, run <code>/kw bind</code> and select "
"your party. Bind each channel separately."
msgstr ""
"En cada canal que quieras usar, ejecuta <code>/kw bind</code> y elige tu "
"grupo. Vincula cada canal por separado."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:49
msgid "For players"
msgstr "Para jugadores"

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:51
msgid ""
"Connect your Discord account to Kettlewright using the button above. Your"
" character must belong to the party bound to the channel."
msgstr ""
"Conecta Discord con Kettlewright mediante el botón de arriba. Tu "
"personaje debe pertenecer al grupo vinculado al canal."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:52
msgid ""
"In a bound channel, run <code>/kw select</code> and choose one of your "
"characters from the list. Your choice is personal to you in that channel."
msgstr ""
"En un canal vinculado, ejecuta <code>/kw select</code> y elige uno de tus"
" personajes. La selección es personal en ese canal."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:58
msgid "Discord commands"
msgstr "Comandos de Discord"

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:60
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "Función"

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:62
msgid "Shows a private link to connect your Discord account to Kettlewright."
msgstr "Muestra un enlace privado para conectar Discord con Kettlewright."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:63
msgid ""
"Warden only: binds the current channel to one of your parties. Requires "
"Manage Channels or Administrator permission. Binding again clears "
"character selections in this channel."
msgstr ""
"Solo Guardiana: vincula el canal a uno de tus grupos. Requiere gestionar "
"canales o administrador. Vincular de nuevo borra las selecciones de "
"personaje del canal."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:64
msgid ""
"Warden only: removes the current channel’s party binding and clears its "
"character selections. Requires Manage Channels or Administrator "
"permission."
msgstr ""
"Solo Guardiana: desvincula el grupo del canal y borra sus selecciones de "
"personaje. Requiere gestionar canales o administrador."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:65
msgid ""
"Selects one of your characters in this channel’s party. The selection "
"applies only to you in this channel."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona un personaje tuyo del grupo del canal. Solo se aplica a ti en "
"ese canal."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:66
msgid ""
"Shows your selected character’s current stats, HP, armor, conditions and "
"sheet link in the channel."
msgstr ""
"Muestra las características, PG, armadura, condiciones y enlace a la hoja"
" del personaje seleccionado en el canal."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:67
msgid ""
"Shows the party roster and current stats in the channel. Use /kw party "
"page:2 for another page."
msgstr ""
"Muestra los miembros y las características actuales del grupo en el "
"canal. Usa /kw party page:2 para otra página."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:68
msgid ""
"Rolls for your selected character and posts the result in the channel and"
" Kettlewright party history. Also accepts 2d6 or d6+d8; at most two dice "
"of types d4, d6, d8, d10, d12, d20 or d100."
msgstr ""
"Tira por el personaje seleccionado y publica el resultado en el canal e "
"historial de grupo de Kettlewright. También admite 2d6 o d6+d8; como "
"máximo dos dados d4, d6, d8, d10, d12, d20 o d100."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:69
msgid ""
"Opens private dice buttons for your selected character. Tap to roll on "
"mobile; results appear in the channel and KW history."
msgstr ""
"Abre botones privados de dados para tu personaje. Toca para tirar en "
"móvil; los resultados aparecen en el canal y en el historial de KW."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:70
msgid ""
"Changes your current HP, STR, DEX or WIL. Use mode:set to set a value "
"instead. Values must stay between zero and the maximum."
msgstr ""
"Cambia los PG, FUE, DES o VOL actuales. Usa mode:set para fijar el valor."
" Debe permanecer entre cero y el máximo."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:71
msgid ""
"Applies or clears Deprived or Panicked on your character. Use "
"active:false to clear a condition."
msgstr ""
"Aplica o elimina privación o pánico en tu personaje. Usa active:false "
"para eliminar una condición."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:72
msgid ""
"Adds Fatigue to your main inventory if it fits. Use /kw remove to clear "
"Fatigue."
msgstr ""
"Añade fatiga al inventario principal si cabe. Usa /kw remove para "
"quitarla."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:73
msgid ""
"Privately lists your items, containers and remaining uses or charges. Use"
" page:2 for more."
msgstr ""
"Lista de forma privada tus objetos, contenedores y usos o cargas "
"restantes. Usa page:2 para ver más."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:74
msgid ""
"Adds a catalog or custom item to your inventory. Supports container, "
"tags, uses, charges and description. Does not spend gold."
msgstr ""
"Añade un objeto del catálogo o personalizado al inventario. Admite "
"contenedor, etiquetas, usos, cargas y descripción. No gasta oro."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:75
msgid ""
"Spends one use. Supports amount and resource:charges. Add remove-"
"empty:true to remove an exhausted item."
msgstr ""
"Consume un uso. Admite amount y resource:charges. Añade remove-empty:true"
" para eliminar un objeto agotado."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:76
msgid "Permanently removes one of your items. Choose it from autocomplete."
msgstr "Elimina permanentemente un objeto tuyo. Elígelo en el autocompletado."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:77
msgid ""
"Leaves an item in the party’s on the ground container. You must describe "
"where you left it."
msgstr ""
"Deja un objeto en el contenedor «en el suelo» del grupo. Debes describir "
"dónde lo dejaste."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:78
msgid ""
"Leaves a container and its contents on the ground. The main inventory "
"cannot be dropped."
msgstr ""
"Deja un contenedor y su contenido en el suelo. El inventario principal no"
" se puede dejar."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:79
msgid "Lists the party’s dropped items and containers with their locations."
msgstr "Lista los objetos y contenedores dejados por el grupo con sus ubicaciones."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:80
msgid ""
"Picks up an item or restores a container with its contents to your "
"selected character. Checks space before picking up."
msgstr ""
"Recoge un objeto o restaura un contenedor y su contenido para tu "
"personaje. Comprueba el espacio antes."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:81
msgid "Moves an item between your personal containers."
msgstr "Mueve un objeto entre tus contenedores."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:82
msgid ""
"Gives one of your items to another character in this party if their main "
"inventory has room."
msgstr ""
"Da un objeto tuyo a otro personaje del grupo si su inventario principal "
"tiene espacio."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:83
msgid ""
"Appends to your character notes without replacing existing text. The note"
" is not posted to Discord."
msgstr ""
"Añade texto a las notas sin sustituir lo existente. La nota no se publica"
" en Discord."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:86
msgid ""
"Character cards, party summaries and rolls are visible to everyone who "
"can read the channel. Account connection, binding, selection and error "
"messages are private to you."
msgstr ""
"Las tarjetas de personaje, resúmenes y tiradas son visibles para quienes "
"lean el canal. La conexión, vinculación, selección y errores son "
"privados."

#: app/templates/auth/discord.html:87
msgid ""
"Sheet actions only affect your own selected character. Their "
"confirmations, inventory lists and dice panels are private. Changes are "
"saved in KW; reload an open character sheet to see them."
msgstr ""
"Las acciones de hoja solo afectan a tu personaje seleccionado. "
"Confirmaciones, inventarios y paneles de dados son privados. Los cambios "
"se guardan en KW; recarga la hoja abierta para verlos."

#: app/templates/auth/mfa_settings.html:7 app/templates/auth/mfa_verify.html:8
msgid "Disable email verification"
msgstr "Desactivar verificación por correo"

#: app/templates/auth/mfa_settings.html:8
msgid ""
"Email verification is currently enabled. After you disable it, you will "
"sign in with your password only."
msgstr ""
"La verificación por correo está activada. Al desactivarla, iniciarás "
"sesión solo con tu contraseña."

#: app/templates/auth/mfa_settings.html:10 app/templates/auth/mfa_verify.html:6
msgid "Enable email verification"
msgstr "Activar verificación por correo"

#: app/templates/auth/mfa_settings.html:11
msgid ""
"Email verification is currently disabled. After you enable it, you will "
"need a code from your email each time you sign in with your password."
msgstr ""
"La verificación por correo está desactivada. Al activarla, necesitarás un"
" código de correo cada vez que inicies sesión con tu contraseña."

#: app/templates/auth/mfa_settings.html:13
msgid ""
"Enter your current password. We will email you a code to confirm this "
"change on the next screen."
msgstr ""
"Introduce tu contraseña actual. Te enviaremos un código para confirmar el"
" cambio en la siguiente pantalla."

