#: app/templates/campaigns/delete_campaign.html:6
#: app/templates/campaigns/workspace.html:43
msgid ""
"Deleting this campaign permanently deletes all its articles, drawings and"
" published party versions. This cannot be undone. Connected parties and "
"their characters are kept."
msgstr ""
"Eliminar la campaña borra permanentemente sus artículos, dibujos y "
"versiones publicadas para los grupos. No se puede deshacer. Los grupos "
"conectados y sus personajes se conservan."

#: app/templates/campaigns/delete_campaign.html:7
